msgid "Deals lightning damage with a potency of 300 to all nearby enemies.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Interrupts all nearby enemies<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Increases damage taken by enemies with <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Magical Aversion</ui-edge-color></ui-color> by 10%<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>60s"
